@startuml
title Sequência 4 — Evidência ausente e retomada do caso
autonumber
hide footbox

participant "Document Intelligence" as DocAI
queue "Event Backbone" as Events
participant "Workflow Orchestrator" as Workflow
database "Case Store" as CaseDb
participant "Notification Service" as Notify
actor "Canal / cliente" as Channel
participant "Case Intake API" as Intake
participant "Evidence Service" as Evidence

DocAI -> Events: backoffice.evidence.missing\nmissingTypes + deadline
Events -> Workflow: evidence.missing
Workflow -> CaseDb: transition MORE_EVIDENCE_REQUIRED
Workflow -> Notify: request missing evidence notification
Notify --> Channel: solicita documentos faltantes

Channel -> Intake: upload complement
Intake -> Evidence: register source and checksum
Intake -> Events: document.received
Events -> DocAI: process complement
DocAI -> Evidence: create new evidence version
DocAI -> Events: document.validated
Events -> Workflow: document.validated
Workflow -> CaseDb: invalidate pending recommendation
Workflow -> CaseDb: transition DOCUMENTS_VALIDATED
Workflow -> Workflow: resume investigation from checkpoint

note right of Workflow
Mudança relevante em evidência
invalida recomendação ainda não executada.
end note
@enduml
